# Bus shelter (back layer, no outlines) under the wartehaus_dach tiles:
# two thin d posts, a faint glass back panel s with h reflections and
# m rails, a timetable case without text (d frame, i paper, m lines), a
# low dark bench (d seat, m backrest: not a platform, D-038), m/d plinth.
# Rows 0..15 sit behind the roof tiles (row 12 when the bottom is on the
# street top, row 15).
sprite = wartehaus
size   = 48x48
origin = 24,48
anim   = idle frames=1
